 phase_init normally when single-executor\"\n338:      After all lineages complete, jump directly to phase_synthesis — skip phase_init and\n339:      phase_main_loop entirely (those are the single-executor path). The merge step in\n340:      phase_synthesis will consolidate results across all lineages.\n362:  phase_init:\n576:      step_create_state_log:\n779:      step_init_complete:\n903:          skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1207:                  skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1210:              skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1213:            skip_to: phase_synthesis\n1577:      step_reduce_state:\n1612:        source_note: \"step_reduce_state has just rewritten all three, so the freshest view of this lineage is already on disk. No index, daemon or network call is involved.\"\n1708:  phase_synthesis:\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"grep -n \\\"phase_init\\\\|phase_main_loop\\\\|phase_synthesis\\\\|step_create_state_log\\\\|step_reduce_state\\\\|step_resolve_artifact_root\\\\|step_init\\\\|node:\\\" .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research.yaml | head -80\"}"},"time":{"start":1794801359710,"end":1794801360302}}}}
