ce the 2,500 ms caller budget, so a path that honours its own wait can only be observed as a caller timeout.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/skill-advisor-cli.ts\\\"]})\\nrows.append({\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The 664 unavailable health rows price a cold fail-open at p50 0 ms and p95 2 ms, so the population that should carry the cold cost carries none of it.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"$TMPDIR/speckit-skill-advisor-metrics/*.jsonl\\\"]})\\nrows.append({\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"What would confirm the bound: one sandbox cold start with the embed model unloaded, recording hook wall time, cascade probe duration and fail-open reason.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[b+\\\"/008-embedder-setup-and-cost/spec.md\\\"]})\\nrows.append({\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Reading a cold first-prompt cost from the health records\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The fail-open branch writes 0 ms, so the record cannot carry it.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5})\\nwith p.open(\\\"w\\\",encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as fh:\\n    for r in rows: fh.write(json.dumps(r,ensure_ascii=False)+\\\"\\\\n\\\")\\nprint(\\\"rows\\\",len(rows))\\nPY\\njq -c . specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/performance-5/deltas/iter-005.jsonl >/dev/null && echo VALID && head -1 specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/performance-5/deltas/iter-005.jsonl > \\\"$TMPDIR/perf5-iter005-event.json\\\" && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory \\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/performanc