{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794802934813,"sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffeT6EyjaVEb2SkHU","part":{"partID":"prt_1e2975a6c001POWPkDO27qaqri","sessionID":"ses_e1d814441ffeT6EyjaVEb2SkHU","messageID":"msg_1e2972aeb001fe5nwSRaJ2eJCA","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9680e30cd5c832f3","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/performance-5 && grep -E \"^- Status:|^- Iteration:\" \"$L/deep-research-dashboard.md\" | head -3; echo \"=== answered ===\"; sed -n '/ANCHOR:key-questions/,/ANCHOR:answered-questions/p' \"$L/deep-research-strategy.md\" | head -8; echo \"=== git status (should be only lineage) ===\"; git status --short | head -20; echo \"=== count outside lineage ===\"; git status --short | grep -v \"lineages/performance-5\" | wc -l"},"output":"- Status: COMPLETE\n- Iteration: 8 of 8\n=== answered ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n- [x] What does the advisor hook cost per prompt on the built state after phases 016 to 033, and does any measured path exceed its runtime's hook budget?\n- [x] What ended the 41 capped turns in the phase 033 untuned arm, and can a runtime-keyed wall-clock cap reduce them without changing the measured outcome?\n- [x] What does one brief cost in bytes and tokens on the built state, and which remaining byte is removable without losing the offer contract?\n- [x] Does the pre-model hook and brief cost consume a measurable share of a behaviour-runner turn's wall clock, so that it competes with the turn cap?\n- [x] Which latency instrument reports the built state's true p95, and which path does it still miss (cold first prompt, in-process plugin, Codex adapter)?\n\n=== git status (should be only lineage) ===\n M specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing